  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Crushing strikes from this flail leave the wicked of heart reeling. Its pitted head carries a stinging, caustic bite that lingers in open wounds. A grim tool of the Mordor Slaughterer, it is built for the brutal labor of culling enemies."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Rough-hewn iron links connect a thick, pitted head to a short handle of charred wood. The metal is pitted by corrosion and carries the grime of a thousand desperate skirmishes."
    }
  },
